但在这一集里，他们确实把她打扮得很亮眼。

496
00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.510
She had a push-up bra on and her hair off.
她穿了聚拢文胸，头发也盘起来了。

497
00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:25.090
It doesn't matter.
那不重要。

498
00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:29.810
Even on our plainest day, Amy Adams is Jenna 6.0.
就算在我们最朴素的时候，艾米·亚当斯也是珍娜6.0。

499
00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:30.350
She is.
她是。

500
00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:30.910
No, she's not.
不，她不是。

501
00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:31.830
It's okay with me.
我没意见。

502
00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:32.510
No, I'm not.
不，我不是。

503
00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:32.930
I'm not.
我不是。

504
00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:33.270
No.
不。

505
00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:34.290
Well, oh, okay.
好吧，噢，行吧。

506
00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:35.310
Well, whatever.
好吧，随你便。

507
00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.750
Should I have not said that?
我是不是不该说那个？

508
00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.410
No, I think you, no, I think it's a funny story.
不，我觉得你……不，我觉得那是个有趣的故事。

509
00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:43.370
But as your best friend, I'm not going to let you say Amy Adams is a better version of
但作为你最好的朋友，我不能让你说艾米·亚当斯是比你

510
00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:43.510
you.
更好的版本。

511
00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:46.670
It's like we look similar, but then her nose is a little daintier.
就像我们长得像，但她的鼻子稍微精致一点。

512
00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:49.030
And her cheeks are a little rosier.
脸颊稍微红润一点。

513
00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.430
And her hair is just a little brighter red.
头发的红色也稍微亮一点。

514
00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:52.450
You know what I'm saying?
你明白我的意思吗？

515
00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:56.330
It's just like she just turn it up a couple of notches on the dial and you get Amy AdaMs.
就像是把刻度盘调高了几档，就成了艾米·亚当斯。

516
00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:59.090
Like if you're creating me, right, you get to me.
就像如果你在创造我，对吧，你创造出了我。

517
00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.510
And then if you turn the dial a couple more notches, it turns into Amy AdaMs.
然后如果你再把刻度盘调高几档，就变成了艾米·亚当斯。

518
00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.430
She's Disney you.
她是迪士尼版的你。

519
00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:05.510
She kind of is.
某种程度上确实是。

520
00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:07.110
She's the Disney princess version of me.
她是迪士尼公主版的我。

521
00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:07.590
Yes.
没错。

522
00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:08.870
Angela, do you have a note card?
安吉拉，你有笔记卡吗？

523
00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:10.730
Because you're like handling a note card right now.
因为你现在好像在摆弄一张笔记卡。

524
00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.210
I feel like you want to say a note card.
我觉得你想念一下笔记卡上的内容。

525
00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:13.010
I mean, I have a-
我是说，我有……

526
00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:14.870
It's in your hand and then you're touching them.
它就在你手里，你还在摸它。

527
00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.050
What is it that you want to say?
你想说什么？

528
00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:18.410
Are you annoyed that I'm touching your note cards?
你是因为我碰了你的笔记卡而不高兴吗？

529
00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.190
No, I'm giving you a chance to speak.
不，我是在给你发言的机会。

530
00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:22.090
Oh.
噢。

531
00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:26.490
Oh, thank you so much.
噢，太感谢你了。

